## Benchmark plan(實證)

### 1. 確認 wire 真的是 GETNEXT(不是 GETBULK)

```bash
strace -e sendmsg,recvmsg -p $(pidof iss_subagent) 2>&1 | \
    grep -A2 'sendmsg\|recvmsg' > /tmp/agentx_trace.log
snmpbulkwalk -v2c -c public localhost 1.3.6.1.2.1.2.2
# AgentX PDU 第 2 byte = PDU type;預期看 type=6 (GETNEXT) 而非 type=7 (GETBULK)
```

### 2. 確認 round-trip 數量級

```bash
sudo tcpdump -i lo -w /tmp/proxy.pcap udp port 6161
snmpbulkwalk -v2c -c public -Cr 10 localhost 1.3.6.1.2.1.2.2
# wireshark 數 GETNEXT-Request,應等於 (entries_walked / 10) 數量級
```

### 3. P50 / P99 對照

```bash
for backend in proxy agentx; do
    for tool in snmpwalk snmpbulkwalk; do
        for i in $(seq 1 100); do
            /usr/bin/time -f "%e" $tool -v2c -c public localhost 1.3.6.1.2.1.2.2 \
                >/dev/null 2>>/tmp/$backend.$tool.times
        done
    done
done
# 排序看 P50/P99
```

預期:proxy vs AgentX 在純 transport 上差 ~3x。

### 4. 北京案例情境驗證(單 OID GET)

```bash
# 模擬 NMS 監控,28 port × 4 OID,輪詢 100 次
for oid in 1.3.6.1.2.1.2.2.1.{8,10,14} 1.3.6.1.2.1.31.1.1.1.15; do
    for p in $(seq 1 28); do
        for i in $(seq 1 100); do
            /usr/bin/time -f "%e" snmpget -v 1 -c public localhost $oid.$p \
                >/dev/null 2>>/tmp/beijing.times
        done
    done
done
sort -n /tmp/beijing.times | awk '
    {a[NR]=$1}
    END {
      print "P50:", a[int(NR*0.5)]
      print "P99:", a[int(NR*0.99)]
      print ">50ms ratio:", count/NR; for (i in a) if (a[i] > 0.05) count++
    }'
# 預期(以 Beijing 數據外推):P50 ~3ms,>50ms < 0.1%
```

